{
    "id": "intent.refactor_guidance",
    "version": 3,
    "name": "Refactor guidance",
    "description": "Provide a refactor plan grounded in graph structure, hotspot signals, and entrypoint paths.",
    "input_schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
            "target": {
                "type": "string"
            },
            "depth": {
                "type": "integer",
                "default": 3
            },
            "max_nodes": {
                "type": "integer",
                "default": 900
            }
        },
        "required": [
            "target"
        ]
    },
    "steps": [
        {
            "action": "tool",
            "tool_name": "resolve_symbol",
            "params": {
                "query": "{{input.target}}",
                "prefer_types": [
                    "function",
                    "class",
                    "file"
                ],
                "limit": 10
            },
            "save_as": "t"
        },
        {
            "action": "branch",
            "condition": "{{t.best}}",
            "steps": [
                {
                    "action": "tool",
                    "tool_name": "build_call_graph",
                    "params": {
                        "roots": [
                            "{{t.best.id}}"
                        ],
                        "direction": "in",
                        "depth": 3,
                        "max_nodes": 200
                    },
                    "save_as": "callers"
                },
                {
                    "action": "tool",
                    "tool_name": "build_call_graph",
                    "params": {
                        "roots": [
                            "{{t.best.id}}"
                        ],
                        "direction": "out",
                        "depth": 2,
                        "max_nodes": 200
                    },
                    "save_as": "callees"
                },
                {
                    "action": "tool",
                    "tool_name": "find_entrypoint_paths",
                    "params": {
                        "target_id": "{{t.best.id}}",
                        "limit": 10,
                        "max_hops": 8
                    },
                    "save_as": "eps"
                }
            ],
            "else": [
                {
                    "action": "return",
                    "value": "Target scope '{{input.target}}' not found."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "action": "tool",
            "tool_name": "get_hotspot",
            "params": {
                "path": "{{t.best.file_path}}"
            },
            "save_as": "hot"
        },
        {
            "action": "compose",
            "template": [
                "# Refactor Guidance: {{t.best.name}}",
                "",
                "## Summary",
                "Reviewing refactor impact for `{{t.best.file_path}}` ({{t.best.type}}).",
                "Hotspot Score: {{hot.report[0].total|float}} ({{hot.report[0].issues|length}} issues).",
                "",
                "## Execution Map",
                "### Caller Graph (Inbound Impact)",
                "```mermaid",
                "{{callers.mermaid}}",
                "```",
                "",
                "## Evidence",
                "- **Blast Radius:** {{callers.stats.node_count}} direct/indirect callers will be affected.",
                "- **Complexity:** {{callees.stats.node_count}} dependencies detected in callees graph.",
                "- **Criticality:** Found {{eps.paths|length}} paths from entrypoints to this node.",
                "  {% for p in eps.paths[:3] %}",
                "  - From `{{p.entrypoint}}`: {{p.length}} hops",
                "  {% endfor %}",
                "",
                "## Proposed Plan",
                "1. **Isolate**: Ensure `{{t.best.name}}` has clear interfaces and no side-effects.",
                "2. **Safeguard**: Add/verify integration tests for the found top entrypoint paths.",
                "3. **Refactor**: Simplify logic to reduce the hotspot score from {{hot.report[0].total|float}}.",
                "",
                "## Next Steps",
                "- Use `read_span` to inspect implementation details of high-risk callers.",
                "- Use `intent.change_impact` to verify the proposed changes."
            ],
            "save_as": "answer_md"
        },
        {
            "action": "return",
            "value": "{{answer_md}}"
        }
    ]
}